<<declare $Fishquest_status = "not_started">>
<<declare $Fishquest_amount = 0>>
<<declare $Fishquest_count = 0>>
Fish: Whats up slimes!, Bet you don't get to see flying fish a lot! all the other animals are mad at me because i wouldn't take part in the annual basketball game
Fish: But look I'm a fish and what can I say, I'm afraid of the net
Fish: hehe....
Fish: *cough* 
Fish: To be really good at basketball you have to be really big, and I'm just from another pond man I can't get that big can you sub in for me and I'll give you key in return
-> Slimes: Sure thing, what do you need Fish?
    <<set $Fishquest_status = "started">>
    Fish: Great! can you please get taller for me there should be {$Fishquest_count} slimes around here to do it
-> Slimes: Not right now were busy, sorry.
    Fish: All good, come back soon!
